en:
"Wh-what's there to complain about!?"{w}{p}"Fine, then how about I grant you a wish or something?
{11:0001:0017}~, and all that!
Wahah, wahah!!"{w}

"Wait, hear me out to the end!!{w}...It's a tempting offer, sure,
but don't you think this reward is odd?"{w}{p}"It's far too generous for just recruiting a fighter.{w}You can bet a request like this is almost certainly dirty.
'Dirty' -- you know what that means, right?"{w}

"No matter how much money is in it,
I can't take on a request that dangerous."{w}{p}"So it's void.
I'm planning to tear up the request form, too."{w}

"You people sure are persistent.{w}All right, if you insist that much,
let's make a trade."{w}{p}"Complete three of the requests I'm holding,
and I might just hand it over as a special favor."{w}{p}"Well? Not a bad deal, is it?{w}Got it? Then get to it, and be quick about it!!"{w}
